      <LongDescription>The &lt;noparse&gt;SGT-360 Ocana[CRW-5.2] v3&lt;/noparse&gt; is a size 3 direct guidance missile.  It is based on the SGT-3 body, which is a heavy anti-ship torpedo.  This missile will deliver a Contact Fuze, High Explosive, Shaped warhead.  It homes in on its target using an Active Radar seeker, validating that it is the correct target using a Passive Electro-Optical seeker.

$MISSILESTAT_CONTROLMETHOD: $MISSILEGUIDANCE_MODE_DIRECT
$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE: &lt;b&gt;&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_POS&lt;/color&gt;	&lt;color=#3BC81E&gt;$MISSILESTAT_TARGETINGMODE_TRACK&lt;/color&gt;&lt;/b&gt;

